# Summary

Books are lent to members under the terms of the loan table of these bylaws[[cite:obs-f1f08610df5a8f1c67368c3d7262d6d4e50aad7d "Books are lent to members under the terms of the loan table of these bylaws."]]. Every member may keep a book for a period specified in the loan table, which defines the maximum loan duration allowed.

The loan table specifies that a member may keep a book for twenty-one days.

